    "detailed_description": "\ud83c\udf54 Diner Simulator \u2014 Welcome to Your Dream (and Maybe a Bit of a Nightmare)<br>You finally did it \u2014 your very own cozy little diner is open for business! The locals are lining up, hungry and curious. But are you ready to handle everything yourself?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/8db635e4746d3ea7baaa14dc0a8d016e.poster.avif?t=1752580080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/8db635e4746d3ea7baaa14dc0a8d016e.webm?t=1752580080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/8db635e4746d3ea7baaa14dc0a8d016e.mp4?t=1752580080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Diner Simulator, you're not just the chef \u2014 you're the server, the cleaner, the stock manager, and the heart of the whole operation. Cook meals, serve guests, keep your supplies in check, and make sure the place stays squeaky clean before the next lunch rush hits.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/06d2e9860a10049820e226bb8b934189.poster.avif?t=1752580080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/06d2e9860a10049820e226bb8b934189.webm?t=1752580080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/06d2e9860a10049820e226bb8b934189.mp4?t=1752580080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Feeling overwhelmed? Call in reinforcements! In online co-op (up to 4 players), kitchen chaos turns into hilarious teamwork. Divide the duties, create your own strategies, and see who cracks under pressure first.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/586f28b45ec0b8260242df9afe69fae9.poster.avif?t=1752580080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/586f28b45ec0b8260242df9afe69fae9.webm?t=1752580080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/586f28b45ec0b8260242df9afe69fae9.mp4?t=1752580080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Will your humble caf\u00e9 grow into a restaurant empire... or will it all go up in smoke? The grill is hot \u2014 time to find out.<br><br>\ud83e\uddfe Features:<br>\ud83c\udf73 Solo or Co-Op Mayhem \u2013 Run the entire diner by yourself or team up with friends for a co-op experience full of laughter, yelling, and last-second saves.<br><br>\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 Cook Like a Pro \u2013 Master dozens of recipes, customize your menu, and serve everything from greasy breakfasts to gourmet dishes \u2014 all under pressure.<br><br>\ud83e\uddfc Keep It Clean, Keep It Running \u2013 Manage supplies, clean up messes, fix broken gear, and do all the behind-the-scenes work that keeps the place from falling apart.<br><br>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Upgrade &amp; Personalize \u2013 Expand your diner, decorate the space, add new appliances, and build the ultimate neighborhood hotspot.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 Hilarious Kitchen Chaos \u2013 Slip-ups, shouting, grease fires, picky customers \u2014 experience the true madness of running a diner where anything (and everything) can go wrong.<br><br>Whether you\u2019re chasing five-star reviews or just trying to keep the toast from burning \u2014 Diner Simulator is your ticket to delicious disaster.<br>Ready to take the heat?<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "\ud83c\udf54 Diner Simulator \u2014 Welcome to Your Dream (and Maybe a Bit of a Nightmare)<br>You finally did it \u2014 your very own cozy little diner is open for business! The locals are lining up, hungry and curious. But are you ready to handle everything yourself?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/8db635e4746d3ea7baaa14dc0a8d016e.poster.avif?t=1752580080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/8db635e4746d3ea7baaa14dc0a8d016e.webm?t=1752580080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/8db635e4746d3ea7baaa14dc0a8d016e.mp4?t=1752580080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Diner Simulator, you're not just the chef \u2014 you're the server, the cleaner, the stock manager, and the heart of the whole operation. Cook meals, serve guests, keep your supplies in check, and make sure the place stays squeaky clean before the next lunch rush hits.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/06d2e9860a10049820e226bb8b934189.poster.avif?t=1752580080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/06d2e9860a10049820e226bb8b934189.webm?t=1752580080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/06d2e9860a10049820e226bb8b934189.mp4?t=1752580080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Feeling overwhelmed? Call in reinforcements! In online co-op (up to 4 players), kitchen chaos turns into hilarious teamwork. Divide the duties, create your own strategies, and see who cracks under pressure first.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/586f28b45ec0b8260242df9afe69fae9.poster.avif?t=1752580080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/586f28b45ec0b8260242df9afe69fae9.webm?t=1752580080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684720/extras/586f28b45ec0b8260242df9afe69fae9.mp4?t=1752580080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Will your humble caf\u00e9 grow into a restaurant empire... or will it all go up in smoke? The grill is hot \u2014 time to find out.<br><br>\ud83e\uddfe Features:<br>\ud83c\udf73 Solo or Co-Op Mayhem \u2013 Run the entire diner by yourself or team up with friends for a co-op experience full of laughter, yelling, and last-second saves.<br><br>\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 Cook Like a Pro \u2013 Master dozens of recipes, customize your menu, and serve everything from greasy breakfasts to gourmet dishes \u2014 all under pressure.<br><br>\ud83e\uddfc Keep It Clean, Keep It Running \u2013 Manage supplies, clean up messes, fix broken gear, and do all the behind-the-scenes work that keeps the place from falling apart.<br><br>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Upgrade &amp; Personalize \u2013 Expand your diner, decorate the space, add new appliances, and build the ultimate neighborhood hotspot.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 Hilarious Kitchen Chaos \u2013 Slip-ups, shouting, grease fires, picky customers \u2014 experience the true madness of running a diner where anything (and everything) can go wrong.<br><br>Whether you\u2019re chasing five-star reviews or just trying to keep the toast from burning \u2014 Diner Simulator is your ticket to delicious disaster.<br>Ready to take the heat?<br><br>",
